  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "AoE damage then create energy-consuming zone; when full, gain buff and skill casts spawn shadow duplicates",
    "skill1": "immobilize top attacker, causing HP-loss based on healing received, then AoE in wider range",
    "skill2": "shield weakest ally; explodes on expiry, dealing area damage",
    "skill3": "ATK grows after circular zone fully forms",
    "skill4": "once zone fully forms, summon temporary shadow of an ally to fight alongside",
    "skill5": "external buff grants sustained energy and steadfast state"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Galahad]] needs her circular zone to fill with Energy before shadows and repeated casts come online, so early timing matters. Her ultimate immobilizes the top cumulative damage dealer with HP-loss tied to healing received, then lashes a wider area. The weakest allies gain exploding shields that damage nearby enemies on expiry. Once the zone completes, a shadow duplicate of an ally fights beside her while battle ATK climbs. External Energy support and Steadfast protection help her remain at the circle's center. Early burst that kills her before the zone matures, or pressure that breaks her position, blunts the payoff.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Galahad]] needs time for her Energy circle to fill before shadows and repeated casts come online, while her ultimate binds your top damage dealer and converts received healing into HP-loss. Kill her before the zone matures with [[filter:assassin-delete]] like [[Himmel]] or [[Ravion]], or starve the Energy soak so it never completes. Avoid excess healing on the bound damage dealer, and use [[Lily May]] to catch her opening ultimate. Once the zone is active, end the fight before shadow duplicates and attrition stack."
}
